      "writtenOn": "2024-02-21T01:47:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case I would suggest making ANDROID_BINDER_IPC_RUST depend on ANDROID_BINDER_IPC and also adding ANDROID_BINDER_IPC_C to enable the C version and have all the other options be shared between the two versions instead of duplicating the options.",
      "parentUuid": "98be7d3b_fb53c3c1",
      "revId": "3b4b996b2ca2eb91f7d04ba3a731df44955e56bc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
